00:36:36.890 --> 00:36:41.850
Everyone is sitting, trying to come up with a name to put on their card for Michael.
大家坐在一起，试图想出一个写在给迈克尔卡片上的名字。

773
00:36:42.110 --> 00:36:46.810
We had a fan question from Stephanie, Emily, Laura, and Anne.
我们收到了来自斯蒂芬妮、艾米丽、劳拉和安的粉丝提问。

774
00:36:47.170 --> 00:36:52.350
When giving Michael names of single women he should ask out, Jim writes down Pam's mom.
当给迈克尔推荐适合他追求的单身女性时，吉姆写下了潘的妈妈。

775
00:36:52.630 --> 00:36:53.750
I know.
我知道。

776
00:36:54.130 --> 00:36:54.730
Right?
对吧？

777
00:36:55.090 --> 00:36:59.470
Was this an intentional foreshadowing or just a coincidence?
这是有意埋下的伏笔，还是纯属巧合？

778
00:37:00.050 --> 00:37:02.150
