00:37:48.950 --> 00:37:58.410
So there is sort of this running joke in this episode that didn't fully make it in that, like, Kelly is going to set Michael up with this whole older group of people.
所以这一集里其实有一个没完全播出的连贯笑点，就是凯莉打算把迈克尔介绍给一群年长的人。

793
00:37:59.710 --> 00:38:00.830
The divorcee.
也就是离异人群。

794
00:38:01.070 --> 00:38:07.010
I guess I'll say the writers at this time didn't know yet that they were going to write that storyline.
我想当时的编剧们还不知道他们后来会写这条故事线。

795
00:38:07.010 --> 00:38:09.170
But I think this was the beginning of something.
但我认为这是一切的开端。

796
00:38:09.790 --> 00:38:11.550
It's the group mind, lady.
这就是集体智慧，女士。

797
00:38:11.830 --> 00:38:13.430
There it is in action.
它正在发挥作用呢。

798
00:38:13.430 --> 00:38:16.910
I love that Michael calls Wendy.
我太喜欢迈克尔给温迪打电话了。

799
00:38:19.010 --> 00:38:20.830
It's so funny.
太搞笑了。

800
00:38:21.170 --> 00:38:23.050
Do you know who the voice of Wendy was?
你知道温迪的配音是谁吗？

801
00:38:23.250 --> 00:38:24.730
We got a lot of mail about it.
我们收到了很多关于这件事的邮件。

802
00:38:24.830 --> 00:38:26.690
And I wrote to Kent Zabornak.
我写信给肯·扎博纳克了。

803
00:38:26.890 --> 00:38:30.030
And he did not remember who we caSt.
他不记得我们试镜了谁。

804
00:38:30.270 --> 00:38:38.210
But one of the finalists for the role was Lindsay Broad, who ends up playing an arc on the show.
但该角色的最终入围者之一是林赛·布罗德，她后来在剧中有一段戏份。

805
00:38:38.710 --> 00:38:38.890
Yeah.
是的。

806
00:38:39.410 --> 00:38:41.510
Now, I don't think she got the role.
不过我觉得她当时没拿到这个角色。

807
00:38:41.530 --> 00:38:43.230
I really listened to the voice.
我仔细听了那个声音。

808
00:38:43.430 --> 00:38:44.970
And I think it was someone else.
我觉得是别人。

809
00:38:45.450 --> 00:38:47.350
So I don't have the answer.
所以我没有答案。

810
00:38:47.530 --> 00:38:52.730
But I thought it was very interesting that Lindsay had auditioned for just this voice role.
但我认为很有意思的是，林赛居然去试镜了这个纯声音的角色。

811
00:38:53.330 --> 00:38:53.470
Right.
对的。

812
00:38:53.910 --> 00:38:56.270
Well, you know who's on the case.
你知道谁在查这案子吗。

