00:38:56.550 --> 00:38:57.990
Who's always on the case?
谁一直在查这案子？

814
00:38:58.270 --> 00:38:58.790
Dwight.
德怀特。

815
00:38:59.190 --> 00:38:59.590
Dwight.
德怀特。

816
00:38:59.770 --> 00:39:00.350
He's on the case.
他在查这案子。

817
00:39:00.490 --> 00:39:03.450
He's going to find Michael, the chair model.
他要去找迈克尔的椅子模特。

818
00:39:03.450 --> 00:39:04.010
Yeah.
是的。

819
00:39:04.170 --> 00:39:07.770
And he says, I will find her and I will bring her to you.
他说，我会找到她，并把她带到你面前。

820
00:39:07.910 --> 00:39:11.350
And as God is my witness, she shall bear your fruit.
天啊，我发誓，她会为你的家族开枝散叶。

821
