00:39:55.710 --> 00:39:59.530
And it's not really landing on him that this is horrible news.
而且他还没完全意识到这是一个可怕的消息。

833
00:40:00.050 --> 00:40:01.770
Michael takes the news really hard.
迈克尔对这个消息打击很大。

834
00:40:02.050 --> 00:40:04.370
He has to sit down in Dwight's chair.
他不得不坐在德怀特的椅子上。

835
00:40:05.570 --> 00:40:08.430
And Jim says, Michael, you didn't even know her.
吉姆说，迈克尔，你甚至都不认识她。

