Jones.
呼出留言。

890
00:42:14.110 --> 00:42:16.170
So if you called it, you got that message.
所以如果你打过去，就能听到那条留言。

891
00:42:16.790 --> 00:42:18.370
Yeah, we must have owned it for a bit.
对，我们肯定有一段时间拥有过它。

892
00:42:18.470 --> 00:42:20.330
And we clearly don't own it anymore.
而且我们显然不再拥有它了。

893
00:42:20.510 --> 00:42:21.590
We really don't.
确实没有了。

894
00:42:21.590 --> 00:42:27.410
Well, the other fun fact I have about this little montage is that at 10 minutes, 55 seconds,
好吧，关于这段小蒙太奇，我的另一个趣事是，在10分55秒时，

895
