00:42:49.750 --> 00:42:55.130
on some guy's house in the back deck overlooking the ocean, but it got late in the day and they
在某个人的房子后面的露台上，可以俯瞰大海，但后来天色已晚，他们

902
00:42:55.130 --> 00:42:59.250
didn't want to move the whole crew and the cameras and the lighting and all that stuff.
不想搬动整个剧组、摄像机、灯光以及所有这些设备。

903
00:42:59.850 --> 00:43:05.370
So right behind the lot where they shoot all the scenes where the office is, is a residential
所以，就在他们拍摄办公室所有场景的场地后面，是一个居民

